---
description: ECB API and pagination rules
globs: "src/routes/**,src/services/**/*query*,src/services/**/*pagination*"
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `architecture.api` before changing query behavior. ECB query endpoints serve local PostgreSQL state and never call Socrata. `openOnly` means ACTIVE; `unpaidOnly` means balance_due > 0. Property ECB ordering/cursor must implement the specified NULL-aware keyset semantics. Portfolio results also require current `property_bins` membership.
